          "start_ms": null,
          "status": "machine-unreviewed",
          "text": "Description: On November 2, 1978, between 6:45 PM and 7:30 PM, several people in the departments of Loire and Haute-Loire observed the movements of a luminous object composed of several lights of different colors. Despite discrepancies in testimonies, all witnesses were intrigued by the absence of noise from this object. Despite a gendarmerie investigation, too few information were gathered to solidify any hypothesis.",
